Package: NNPreg
Title: Nuclear Norm Penalized Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mayukh", "Choudhury", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mayukh.iitb@gmail.com")
Description: Fits nuclear norm penalized multivariate linear regression 
    models using the fast iterative shrinkage-thresholding algorithm 
    (FISTA) of Beck and Teboulle (2009) <doi:10.1137/080716542>. Provides 
    fixed-penalty estimation, regularization paths, K-fold 
    cross-validation, prediction, coefficient extraction, and diagnostic 
    plots.
